---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About PromptDNS"
  description="PromptDNS provides free DNS, email authentication, and domain health tools plus in-depth guides for webmasters, developers, and IT teams."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">About PromptDNS</h1>
    <div class="rich-text mt-6 max-w-none">
      <p>
        PromptDNS is a free collection of DNS, email-authentication, and domain-health tools with
        one goal: the fastest path from "something is broken" to "here is exactly what to change."
      </p>
      <p>
        Every tool runs in your browser using public DNS-over-HTTPS resolvers, Cloudflare,
        Google, and Quad9. Nothing you look up is sent to our servers, stored, or logged by us.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alongside the tools we publish a complete guide network: every DNS record type, email
        authentication (SPF, DKIM, DMARC, BIMI, MTA-STS), DNS operations and troubleshooting,
        provider playbooks, and the emerging field of AI web infrastructure, llms.txt, AI
        crawler management, and domain readiness for AI search.
      </p>
      <h2>Editorial standards</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Every guide includes verified, step-by-step processes, not summaries.</li>
        <li>Guides embed live results from our own tools so you can verify your own domain as you read.</li>
        <li>Money pages are reviewed and refreshed at least every 90 days.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions, corrections, or tool requests: <code>hello@promptdns.com</code></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core pillars -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 p-5">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Privacy</p>
        <h3 class="font-display mt-2 font-semibold text-ink">Client-side lookups</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Queries resolve directly from your browser via public DoH. Nothing is stored or logged.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 p-5">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Quality</p>
        <h3 class="font-display mt-2 font-semibold text-ink">Verified guides</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Every configuration is tested against real resolvers, updated regularly with live examples.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 p-5">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Access</p>
        <h3 class="font-display mt-2 font-semibold text-ink">Free forever</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">All 56+ diagnostic tools are free with no registration, no rate limits, and no ads.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Explore banner -->
    <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-accent/25 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/10 to-violet/10 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink">Explore PromptDNS</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-lg text-sm text-ink-dim">
        Test your domain configuration right now, or explore our deep technical documentation.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/tools/" class="btn-cta btn-shimmer inline-flex px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold">Browse all tools →</a>
        <a href="/dns/" class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-panel-2 px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ink transition hover:border-accent/40">Read DNS guides →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
